:\"approved\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"AnchorPermissionUpdated\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"previousOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"OwnershipTransferred\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"artifactHash\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes32\",\"name\":\"contextHash\",\"type\":\"bytes32\"},{\"internalType\":\"uint8\",\"name\":\"artifactType\",\"type\":\"uint8\"}],\"name\":\"anchor\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"approvedAnchors\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[],\"name\":\"owner\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"anchor\",\"type\":\"address\"},{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"approved\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"name\":\"setApprovedAnchor\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"newOwner\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"transferOwnership\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"events\":{\"AnchorCreated(bytes32,bytes32,uint8,address,uint256)\":{\"params\":{\"anchoredBy\":\"The approved wallet address that submitted this anchor\",\"artifactHash\":\"keccak256 of the artifact content (PDF bytes, canonical JSON, etc.)\",\"artifactType\":\"1=EPD  2=CERTIFICATION  3=MATERIAL_SCORE  4=MATERIAL_SUBMITTAL  5=SUPPLIER_AUDIT\",\"contextHash\":\"keccak256 of the canonical metadata package\",\"timestamp\":\"block.timestamp at the time of anchoring\"}}},\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"anchor(bytes32,bytes32,uint8)\":{\"params\":{\"artifactHash\":\"keccak256(artifact content) \\u2014 PDF bytes or canonical JSON\",\"artifactType\":\"Enum: 1=EPD 2=CERT 3=SCORE 4=SUBMITTAL 5=AUDIT\",\"contextHash\":\"keccak256(canonical metadata) \\u2014 type, supplierId, materialId, etc.\"}}},\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"events\":{\"AnchorCreated(bytes32,bytes32,uint8,address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted for every anchored artifact.\"}},\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"anchor(bytes32,bytes32,uint8)\":{\"notice\":\"Anchor a verified artifact proof on-chain. Called by the GreenChainz server after verifying an EPD, certification, score snapshot, or submittal. The proof is permanent and immutable once the transaction is confirmed.\"},\"setApprovedAnchor(address,bool)\":{\"notice\":\"Grant or revoke anchor permissions for a server wallet. Call this after deployment to authorize the GreenChainz signing wallet.\"}},\"notice\":\"GreenChainz Proof Ledger \\u2014 AnchorRegistry Stores cryptographic proof that a GreenChainz artifact (EPD, certification, material credit score snapshot, or approved submittal) existed in a specific verified state at a specific time. Security model:   - Only GreenChainz server wallets may call anchor()   - No raw business metadata is stored on-chain   - Only keccak256 hashes are stored (via events)   - Owner can rotate approved anchor wallets without redeploying Deploy once to Polygon PoS (chainId 137) or Amoy testnet (chainId 80002).\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/AnchorRegistry.sol\":\"AnchorRegistry\"},\"evmVersion\":\"osaka\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":false,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"contracts/AnchorRegistry.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xdda7334b7bd7db96153cc90b2719a1f1f252c18e0cd23b1e964e4e0f2b45d079\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://44be8d8d56e8cc9